    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "暂存预检",
      "items": [
        "部分暂存文件会被拒绝，防止检查内容 ≠ 提交内容",
        "无暂存文件时 pre-commit 直接放行（exit 0）",
        "Prettier / cargo fmt / cfg-hygiene 自动修复并重新暂存"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "变更分类检查",
      "items": [
        "前端变更跑 lint:fe + test:fe + build:fe",
        "后端变更跑 cargo fmt + cfg-hygiene + clippy + test:be",
        "docs、workflow 变更走轻量检查（check:docs / check:ci-platforms）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "提交信息门",
      "items": [
        "要求 Conventional Commits：type(scope)!: subject",
        "type 限定白名单（feat / fix / docs / ci / …）",
        "Merge / Revert / fixup 前缀直接放行，body 行 ≤ 500 字符"
